овом месте ей придется не меньше, чем на тренировках. И на кону уже не медаль, а собственная жизнь!","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"318411","ru":"ACP Vikrant","en":"ACP Vikrant","year":"2026","type":"Сериал","rating":0.0,"votes":0,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/rJ1bSpN3sTBxIxYluRTFYrieXyQ.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pM2QRpEAMDgjZS8RNR9kK5VJUu.jpg","genres":["криминал","драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"318267","ru":"Nerdland voor Kleine Nerds","en":"Nerdland voor Kleine Nerds","year":"2026","type":"Сериал","rating":0.0,"votes":0,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/iqT3CuXBXxlOJWVsINLQp7CjTdV.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xhr3sQoyGAMhyD47yikq1t1MYWJ.jpg","genres":[],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"315650","ru":"Holland Gate – de vlucht uit Kabul","en":"Holland Gate – de vlucht uit Kabul","year":"2026","type":"Сериал","rating":0.0,"votes":0,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/vxAeFZIybtHCeLGGva7XtgCAUt0.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pUj5E5D2dvYK9cKdO6u1AbUA0QI.jpg","genres":[],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"317693","ru":"Àngela y Archie: Tras la pantalla","en":"Àngela y Archie: Tras la pantalla","year":"2026","type":"Сериал","rating":0.0,"votes":0,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/gaCiIOu3uizn52vtz5yfOo0E1r2.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lw2bsMIrSg0wO0B5fud8bOfdwZJ.jpg","genres":["документальный"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"317439","ru":"Die Diplomaten - Inside Auswärtiges Amt","en":"Die Diplomaten - Inside Auswärtiges Amt","year":"2026","type":"Сериал","rating":0.0,"votes":0,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/i2skQeaXFEJTg2YlD7oNqMDOLcd.jpg","backdrop":"https: